<title>UK: Britain clears FKI's proposed Newman buy.</title>
<headline>Britain clears FKI's proposed Newman buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Department of Trade and Industry on Tuesday cleared engineering UK group FKI Plc's proposed acquisition of Newman Tonks Plc.</p>
<p>FKI's hostile bid faced competition from U.S. group Ingersoll Rand Co, which unveiled on Monday a recommended cash offer for Newman.</p>
</text>
